; Shared conventions block: the measured Survex idiom of a single file
; beside the cave folder holding the *data / *calibrate settings every
; cave master pulls in with *include "../conventions.svx". It opens no
; *begin of its own, so the including file's scope stays intact.
; Used by [Sync][Reconcile] and [Attach] rebase tests.
*data normal from to tape compass clino
*calibrate declination 0.0
